# Last updated date (mousavi-site)

Whenever you change website content in this repository (HTML, CSS, JS, files linked from the site, etc.):

1. Update `SITE_LAST_UPDATED` in `assets/js/site.js` to the current local datetime as an ISO 8601 string with offset, e.g. `2026-08-12T07:30:00-07:00`.
2. Also update the visible fallback text and `datetime` on each page's `<time class="js-site-last-updated">` in the footer so it matches (include date and time).

Do this in the same task before committing. Do not leave a stale last-updated stamp after content edits.
